@baseUrl = http://localhost:5165
@user = master1
@roles = MasterMaintainer

### 売上一覧
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales?salesDateFrom=2026-04-01&salesDateTo=2026-04-30&customerCode=CUST001
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}

### 売上一覧(監査用: 取消済み・取消売上を含む)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales?includeCanceled=true&includeCorrections=true
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}

### 売上詳細
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/1
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}

### 売上明細入力補助
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/line-preview?salesDate=2026-04-15&customerId=1&productId=1
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}

### 売上日時点の得意先確認は得意先 API を使用
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/1?asOf=2026-04-15
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}

### 売上登録
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}
X-Dummy-Roles: {{roles}}

{
  "salesDate": "2026-04-15",
  "customerId": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1.005,
      "unitPrice": 100.01
    }
  ]
}

### 売上取消
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}
X-Dummy-Roles: {{roles}}

{
  "reason": "数量を誤って登録したため"
}
